=\"Vcs.Log.Tabs.Properties\">\r\n    <option name=\"TAB_STATES\">\r\n      <map>\r\n        <entry key=\"MAIN\">\r\n          <value>\r\n            <State />\r\n          </value>\r\n        </entry>\r\n      </map>\r\n    </option>\r\n  </component>\r\n  <component name=\"VcsManagerConfiguration\">\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add i18n support with EN/TH toggle&#10;&#10;Introduce English and Thai translations for the application, including language toggle via `LanguageToggle` widget. Add JSON-based i18n catalogs (`locales/en.json`, `locales/th.json`) and a dynamic translation mechanism (`i18n.py`, `i18n_widgets.py`). Update UI components for language adaptability and include unit tests to validate translation functionality.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"minor adjustment\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Enhance login UI and streamline theme handling&#10;&#10;Introduce a responsive login window with improved styling via `login.css` and QSS updates. Consolidate theme-related logic into `theme.py`, retiring duplicate code from `main_window.py`. Enable server-side distinct value fetching for enhanced tag filtering and update filters UI behavior accordingly. Add new translations to support login-related text in EN/TH (`locales/en.json`, `locales/th.json`).\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Split `db.py` into a structured `db/` package&#10;&#10;Refactor `db.py` into an organized package with modular submodules: `connection.py`, `auth.py`, `schema.py`, `queries.py`, `hierarchy.py`, `serial_state.py`, `edge_mirror.py`, and `containers.py`. Introduce three new helper functions (`_save_changes`, `_update_staging_serial_data`, `save_grid_changes`) to unify grid-save into a single transaction. Update `db/__init__.py` for proper re-exports while preserving API compatibility.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add `ContainerPanel` UI and bulk delete feature; integrate with database and tests\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add product avatar support&#10;&#10;Introduce `AvatarCatalog` for normalized product images based on packaging levels. Add `avatars.json` and `product-avatars.md` for image mappings and documentation. Update `ContainerPanel` to display avatars alongside container info. Enhance database queries to include distinct product data. Add integration tests to validate product avatar functionality.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add non-modal product image preview&#10;&#10;Introduce `ImagePreview` for viewing product images without blocking the UI. Add `AvatarLabel` to make product avatars interactive. Update `ContainerPanel` to support preview functionality and ensure previews persist during container refresh. Add related tests and new translations for the feature.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add tests and improve UX for barcode rename dialog&#10;&#10;Introduce `test_barcode_rename.py` with new test cases to validate barcode renaming flow, including keyboard scanner behavior and prefill handling. Enhance `RenameContainerDialog` UX with auto-focus logic, event filtering, placeholder texts, and delayed preview updates. Update translations to include additional text for improved guidance.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add comprehensive DataRework workflow guide&#10;&#10;Introduce a detailed HTML documentation covering DataRework's architecture, workflows, data contracts, queries, and proposed development extensions. Designed for developers and operators, this guide emphasizes system understanding and scalability paths. Includes responsive design, print-friendly styling, and organized sections for usability.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add user tag propagation and tests&#10;&#10;Extend login and main window logic to include user `tag_name` propagation. Update database changes to include operator tags, ensuring robust data tracking. Add associated tests to validate user tag integration in workflows and save operations.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add in-memory error logging and non-modal log viewer&#10;&#10;Introduce `debug_log.py` with an in-memory log for error tracking, featuring a non-modal `LogWindow` for viewing detailed messages and tracebacks. Update `main_window.py` to integrate error logging, replacing `print` statements with structured log entries. Enhance status updates to include traceback logs and improve error visibility. Add minor UI and style updates for the new log functionality.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Implement shared English/Thai typography and UI font scaling&#10;&#10;Add `typography.py` to resolve a single installed font covering English and Thai text, ensuring consistent font selection across language switches without downloads. Integrate typography with `theme.py` to propagate font families and log pixel sizes into stylesheets. Update UI components and tests to reflect natural Thai shaping, button size stability, and glyph coverage validation. Adjust layouts and styles for improved multilingual text rendering adaptability.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"button adjustment\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Container deletion method. [Delete container]\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add container deletion preview, logic, and dialog&#10;&#10;Introduce `delete_dialog.py` for reviewing containers before deletion. Add `_test_container_delete_pg.py` for validating SQL correctness and scenarios in PostgreSQL temporary tables. Implement `db/deletion.py` for logic to clean up containers and their dependencies.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add level marks for containers and navigation history in `ContainerPanel`&#10;&#10;Introduce visual &quot;level marks&quot; for each packaging level to enhance clarity. Add navigation history with breadcrumbs and Back/Forward controls for improved user navigation. Update styles, translations, and tests to support these enhancements.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add analytics for mismatched container data and enhance container deletion logic&#10;&#10;Introduce `link_table_mismatch.sql` for diagnosing data discrepancies between saved rows and the link table. Update `container_delete` logic to handle levels with missing links by listing saved contents for user clarity. Expand PostgreSQL tests to validate these scenarios. Improve filter syncing behavior in the main window and adjust `.idea` settings for database object filtering.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Expand container deletion logic to handle serials at all levels&#10;&#10;Refine `delete_container` to deactivate serials for containers, sub-containers, and emptied ancestors. Update tests to validate multi-level serial deactivation and adjust SQL logic for comprehensive container clean-up. Ensure robust handling of `tag_name` for better traceability.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Introduce `db_worker.py` for async DB operations and integrate off-thread execution&#10;&#10;Implement `db_worker.py` to offload database calls from the Qt UI thread, preventing UI freezing during network round trips. Refactor related calls in `MainWindow` and `ContainerPanel` to run asynchronously. Introduce caching for repeated column and primary key lookups in `db/schema.py`. Update tests to validate async behavior, caching, and UI-thread result handling.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Tag serial changing with roll_no staging_serial_data\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add `DamageReportPanel` for reporting damaged serials and related database logic&#10;&#10;Introduce `DamageReportPanel` to enable operators to flag serials as damaged, ensuring inactive status prior to reporting. Update database logic with `report_damage` and `serial_level` support, handling conflicts like active or unknown serials. Add tests for panel interactions, backend validation, and roll_no syncing in `serial_store_aio`.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add `rework` permission check and update related user experience&#10;&#10;Introduce an additional `rework` permission check in `authenticate` function and adjust error handling for restricted users. Update translations and modify UI labels in login and main windows to improve clarity.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"tests adjustment\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"nssm root path on build.ps1\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Auth adjustment + user management\" />\r\n    <option name=\"LAST_COMMIT_MESSAGE\" value=\"Auth adjustment + user management\" />\r\n  </component>\r\n</project>
